  <Docs>
    <summary>Identifies the kind of result that the caller requests from an <see cref="T:Android.AdServices.OnDevicePersonalization.IsolatedService" />.</summary>
    <remarks>The values correspond to the <c>OUTPUT_TYPE_*</c> constants in Android's <c>ExecuteInIsolatedServiceRequest.OutputSpec</c>. With the null output type, the platform ignores the service result. With the best value output type, the platform returns a noised integer from the service. See the <format type="text/html"><a href="https://android.googlesource.com/platform/packages/modules/OnDevicePersonalization/+/cc93f1e4164d0a4bb76dd277abc221f4eaf32efb/framework/java/android/adservices/ondevicepersonalization/ExecuteInIsolatedServiceRequest.java#L92">output type constants</a></format>.</remarks>
  </Docs>
